### Customer payment administration: record an amount received for a shipment.
### Type is CUSTOMER_PAYMENT or AGENT_INCOME; both count towards total income.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/shipments/SHP-2026-0099/incomes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "CUSTOMER_PAYMENT",
  "amount": 7000.00,
  "description": "Main carriage invoice"
}
